Error [jet.DynAsCondition]: This range counts down from 3 to 0 and holds no numbers
  --> main.jet:2:13
    |
  2 |     print(<:3..0:>)
    |             ^^^^
 Why: A range value always counts up from its start, so a bigger start leaves it empty
 Fix: Write the smaller end first, `0..3`; count down in a loop with `3..0, -1`
